---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="ChatGPT Ads — Adonyme prépare votre marque à la publicité IA" description="Soyez la marque que ChatGPT recommande à vos prospects. Adonyme vous prépare à ChatGPT Ads : stratégie, ciblage conversationnel, tracking, et socle de visibilité organique IA.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style is:global>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Instrument Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #fcfaf6; color: #0a0a0a; }

    /* Nav */
    .cgpt-nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(252,250,246,0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ede8;
      padding: 0 2rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      height: 64px;
    }
    .cgpt-nav-logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0a0a0a; text-decoration: none; }
    .cgpt-nav-cta {
      display: inline-block; background: #fb6931; color: #fff;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.875rem; text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .cgpt-hero { padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
    .cgpt-badge {
      display: inline-block; background: rgba(251,105,49,0.1); color: #fb6931;
      font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .cgpt-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .cgpt-hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: #fb6931; }
    .cgpt-hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; }
    .cgpt-hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-primary { display: inline-block; background: #fb6931; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2.5rem; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-wa { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: #25D366; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2rem; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; }

    /* Stats */
    .cgpt-stats-wrap { padding: 0 2rem 4rem; }
    .cgpt-stats { background: #0a0a0a; padding: 0; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .cgpt-stat { text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1rem; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
    .cgpt-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .cgpt-stat-num { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fb6931; }
    .cgpt-stat-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-top: 0.3rem; line-height: 1.4; }

    /* Sections */
    .cgpt-section { padding: 5rem 2rem; }
    .cgpt-section-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .cgpt-tag { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #fb6931; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .cgpt-h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .cgpt-h2 em { font-style: italic; color: #fb6931; }
    .cgpt-sub { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 3rem; }

    /* Mockup conversation */
    .cgpt-mockup {
      background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #f0ede8;
      max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .cgpt-mockup-bar {
      background: #f7f7f7; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ede8;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .cgpt-mockup-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .cgpt-mockup-title { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-left: 0.5rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .cgpt-mockup-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
    .cgpt-mockup-question { background: #f0f4ff; border-radius: 12px 12px 4px 12px; padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; display: inline-block; max-width: 90%; }
    .cgpt-mockup-answer { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .cgpt-mockup-ad {
      border: 1.5px solid #fb6931; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(251,105,49,0.04);
    }
    .cgpt-mockup-ad-label { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #fb6931; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .cgpt-mockup-ad-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .cgpt-mockup-ad-desc { font-size: 0.825rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* Funnel Search → Discovery → Conversation */
    .cgpt-funnel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    .cgpt-funnel-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #f0ede8; text-align: center; }
    .cgpt-funnel-card.active { border-color: #fb6931; background: rgba(251,105,49,0.04); }
    .cgpt-funnel-label { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .cgpt-funnel-card.active .cgpt-funnel-label { color: #fb6931; }
    .cgpt-funnel-platform { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .cgpt-funnel-moment { font-size: 0.825rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.5; font-style: italic; }
    .cgpt-funnel-arrow { color: #fb6931; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; }

    /* Context Hints */
    .cgpt-hints-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
    .cgpt-hint-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.75rem; border: 1px solid #f0ede8; }
    .cgpt-hint-sector { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #fb6931; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .cgpt-hint-bubble { background: #f0f4ff; border-radius: 10px 10px 4px 10px; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #0a0a0a; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .cgpt-hint-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* Pourquoi maintenant */
    .cgpt-why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
    .cgpt-why-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.75rem; border: 1px solid #f0ede8; display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; }
    .cgpt-why-num { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 900; color: rgba(251,105,49,0.2); line-height: 1; flex-shrink: 0; width: 2.5rem; }
    .cgpt-why-card h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .cgpt-why-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* Méthode */
    .cgpt-method { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 0; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    .cgpt-method-step { text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem 1rem; position: relative; }
    .cgpt-method-step:not(:last-child)::after { content: '→'; position: absolute; right: -0.5rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: #fb6931; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .cgpt-method-num { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fb6931; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 auto 0.75rem; }
    .cgpt-method-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .cgpt-method-sub { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* Services condensés */
    .cgpt-services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
    .cgpt-service-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid #f0ede8; }
    .cgpt-service-card h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .cgpt-service-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.6; }
    .cgpt-service-list { list-style: none; margin-top: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem; }
    .cgpt-service-list li { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #27454F; display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .cgpt-service-list li::before { content: '→'; color: #fb6931; flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 700; }

    /* Tableau comparatif */
    .cgpt-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #f0ede8; background: #fff; }
    .cgpt-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .cgpt-table th { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; text-align: left; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
    .cgpt-table th:first-child { border-radius: 14px 0 0 0; }
    .cgpt-table th:last-child { border-radius: 0 14px 0 0; }
    .cgpt-table th.col-chatgpt { background: #fb6931; }
    .cgpt-table td { padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ede8; color: #27454F; }
    .cgpt-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .cgpt-table td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: #0a0a0a; }
    .cgpt-table td.col-chatgpt { color: #0a0a0a; font-weight: 600; }

    /* Disponibilité */
    .cgpt-dispo { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #f0ede8; background: #fff; }
    .cgpt-dispo-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ede8; }
    .cgpt-dispo-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .cgpt-dispo-icon { font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; width: 2rem; text-align: center; }
    .cgpt-dispo-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #0a0a0a; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .cgpt-dispo-text { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #27454F; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* Avant / Après */
    .cgpt-avap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .cgpt-avap-col { border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; }
    .cgpt-avap-col.sans { background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #f0ede8; }
    .cgpt-avap-col.avec { background: #0a0a0a; }
    .cgpt-avap-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .cgpt-avap-col.sans .cgpt-avap-title { color: #0a0a0a; }
    .cgpt-avap-col.avec .cgpt-avap-title { color: #fff; }
    .cgpt-avap-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .cgpt-avap-col.sans .cgpt-avap-item { color: #27454F; }
    .cgpt-avap-col.avec .cgpt-avap-item { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }

    /* FAQ */
    .cgpt-faq { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .cgpt-faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ede8; padding: 1.25rem 0; }
    .cgpt-faq-q { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; color: #0a0a0a; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; cursor: default; }
    .cgpt-faq-arrow { color: #fb6931; font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .cgpt-faq-a { color: #27454F; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 0.75rem; }

    /* CTA Banner */
    .cgpt-cta-banner { background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 20px; padding: 4rem 3rem; text-align: center; margin: 0 2rem 4rem; }
    .cgpt-cta-banner h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .cgpt-cta-banner h2 em { font-style: italic; color: #fb6931; }
    .cgpt-cta-banner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .cgpt-cta-btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* Footer */
    .cgpt-footer-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 3rem; }
    .cgpt-footer-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 0.75rem; }

    /* WhatsApp */
    .cgpt-wa { position: fixed; bottom: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem; z-index: 9999; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #25D366; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(37,211,102,0.4); text-decoration: none; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .cgpt-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .cgpt-stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
      .cgpt-stat:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
      .cgpt-funnel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cgpt-funnel-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); }
      .cgpt-hints-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cgpt-why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cgpt-method { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
      .cgpt-method-step:not(:last-child)::after { display: none; }
      .cgpt-services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cgpt-avap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cgpt-table { font-size: 0.8rem; }
      .cgpt-table th, .cgpt-table td { padding: 0.75rem 1rem; }
      .cgpt-cta-banner { margin: 0 1rem 3rem; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; }
      .cgpt-nav { padding: 0 1rem; }
      .cgpt-footer-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem; }
      .cgpt-footer-right { align-items: flex-start; }
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Nav -->
  <nav class="cgpt-nav">
    <a href="/" class="cgpt-nav-logo">Adonyme</a>
    <a href="https://calendly.com/session-acquisition/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cgpt-nav-cta">Démarrer →</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="cgpt-hero">
    <div class="cgpt-badge">CHATGPT ADS — NOUVEAU CANAL IA</div>
    <h1>Soyez la marque que <em>ChatGPT recommande</em> à vos prospects</h1>
    <p>Vos clients ne cherchent plus seulement sur Google : ils demandent à ChatGPT quelle marque choisir. Adonyme vous prépare à ce canal dès maintenant — stratégie, ciblage conversationnel, tracking et socle de visibilité organique IA.</p>
    <div class="cgpt-hero-ctas">
      <a href="https://calendly.com/session-acquisition/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary">Réserver un appel →</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/33768183404?text=Bonjour%2C%20j%27ai%20quelques%20questions%20sur%20ChatGPT%20Ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-wa">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/></svg>
        J'ai une question
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <div class="cgpt-stats-wrap">
    <div class="cgpt-stats">
      <div class="cgpt-stat">
        <div class="cgpt-stat-num">+50</div>
        <div class="cgpt-stat-label">entreprises accompagnées en acquisition B2B</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cgpt-stat">
        <div class="cgpt-stat-num">3 canaux</div>
        <div class="cgpt-stat-label">LinkedIn · Email · IA conversationnelle</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cgpt-stat">
        <div class="cgpt-stat-num">+91 %</div>
        <div class="cgpt-stat-label">de clics payants en plus pour les marques déjà citées par l'IA</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cgpt-stat">
        <div class="cgpt-stat-num">Fév. 2026</div>
        <div class="cgpt-stat-label">lancement officiel de ChatGPT Ads par OpenAI</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mockup visuel -->
  <section class="cgpt-section" style="background: #fcfaf6;">
    <div class="cgpt-section-inner" style="text-align: center;">
      <p class="cgpt-tag">À QUOI ÇA RESSEMBLE</p>
      <h2 class="cgpt-h2">Une recommandation sponsorisée,<br>au cœur de la <em>conversation</em></h2>
      <p class="cgpt-sub" style="margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;">L'annonce s'insère sous la réponse de ChatGPT, clairement étiquetée, au moment exact où votre prospect compare et décide.</p>
      <div class="cgpt-mockup">
        <div class="cgpt-mockup-bar">
          <div class="cgpt-mockup-dot" style="background: #ff5f57;"></div>
          <div class="cgpt-mockup-dot" style="background: #febc2e;"></div>
          <div class="cgpt-mockup-dot" style="background: #28c840;"></div>
          <span class="cgpt-mockup-title">ChatGPT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cgpt-mockup-body">
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <div class="cgpt-mockup-question">Comment trouver une agence pour générer davantage de leads B2B ?</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cgpt-mockup-answer">
            Pour générer des leads B2B de qualité, plusieurs approches complémentaires existent : la prospection LinkedIn outreach, les campagnes email ciblées, et la publicité sur des canaux à forte intention. L'essentiel est de construire un flux de prospects exclusifs sous votre marque, plutôt que d'acheter des listes mutualisées…
          </div>
          <div class="cgpt-mockup-ad">
            <div class="cgpt-mockup-ad-label">SPONSORISÉ</div>
            <div class="cgpt-mockup-ad-name">Adonyme — Agence leads B2B exclusifs</div>
            <div class="cgpt-mockup-ad-desc">On génère un flux de prospects qualifiés sous votre marque via LinkedIn, email et IA. +50 entreprises accompagnées. Audit gratuit.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Funnel Search → Discovery → Conversation -->
  <section class="cgpt-section" style="background: #fff;">
    <div class="cgpt-section-inner">
      <p class="cgpt-tag">OÙ SE SITUE CHATGPT ADS</p>
      <h2 class="cgpt-h2">Google, Meta et ChatGPT ne captent pas<br>la même <em>intention</em></h2>
      <p class="cgpt-sub">Trois canaux, trois moments différents du parcours de décision. ChatGPT intervient là où votre prospect formule encore son problème.</p>
      <div class="cgpt-funnel">
        <div class="cgpt-funnel-card">
          <div class="cgpt-funnel-label">RECHERCHE</div>
          <div class="cgpt-funnel-platform">Google Ads</div>
          <div class="cgpt-funnel-moment">"Je cherche une agence pour améliorer mes campagnes Meta Ads."</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 0.75rem;">Intention déjà exprimée</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cgpt-funnel-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="cgpt-funnel-card">
          <div class="cgpt-funnel-label">DÉCOUVERTE</div>
          <div class="cgpt-funnel-platform">Meta Ads</div>
          <div class="cgpt-funnel-moment">Découverte d'une offre pendant la navigation, au fil du feed.</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 0.75rem;">Attention captée</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cgpt-funnel-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="cgpt-funnel-card active">
          <div class="cgpt-funnel-label">CONVERSATION</div>
